formats:**"],[1244,"**git-marketplace**: Git repository with `marketplace.json` for skill discovery"],[292,"**Global lock**: `~/.config/fastskill/global-skills.lock` (Linux/macOS) or `%APPDATA%\\fastskill\\global-skills.lock` (Windows)"],[1322,"**Grid**: Human-readable columnar layout with the same fields as table"],[1692,"**Grid**: Simple list format for commands with many columns"],[1432,"**How it works:**"],[3088,"**HTTP registry**: an HTTP index and downloadable skill artifacts."],[1248,"**http-registry**: HTTP-based registry with flat skill index"],[2879,"**ID** → Second directory level (the package name, must not contain slashes, e.g., \"web-scraper\")"],[2801,"**If you omit `checks` from `optimize.toml` entirely, there is no grading signal at all**: with zero checks configured, every case's result list is empty, and an empty list scores `1.0` under every `gate_metric` (vacuously — \"zero required checks passed\" is trivially true). In that configuration every candidate patch looks perfect, so the gate has nothing meaningful to accept or reject on. Always configure `checks` for a real run."],[3076,"**Include all metadata**: Provide tags, capabilities, and author information"],[2831,"**Incremental index rebuilding.** A change-detection cache (`.fastskill/build-cache.json`) lets\nFastSkill\nre-embed only what actually changed, so keeping the index current is cheap."],[1972,"**Index for search**: `fastskill index rebuild` (requires `OPENAI_API_KEY`)."],[1971,"**Install from the manifest**: `fastskill project install`."],[3246,"**Installed Skills** - Skills actually present in `.claude/skills/`"],[1670,"**Installing from a subdirectory**: Declare a Git origin with a clean clone URL and `subdir` in your manifest; see Git sources."],[823,"**Installs Skills**: Stages and commits each overlapping dependency closure as one recovery unit"],[1453,"**Intelligent Matching**: Understands synonyms and related concepts"],[713,"**Invalid IDs:**"],[699,"**Invalid versions:**"],[1323,"**JSON**: Machine-readable array with fields: id, scope, name, description, latest\\_version, published\\_at, and optionally versions array"],[1693,"**JSON**: Machine-readable array with same fields plus reconciliation status"],[608,"**Judge errors and excluded trials.** A trial whose judgment errored contributes nothing to a `judge_score` — not a zero — and is counted in `totals.judge_errors`. A trial a gated judge could not judge is counted in `totals.judge_excluded_trials`."],[583,"**Judges**"],[335,"**Keep FastSkill up to date** to get lock file improvements and bug fixes"],[3074,"**Keep it updated**: Regenerate `marketplace.json` when skills change"],[2828,"**Keyword fallback otherwise.** If no embedding provider is configured, semantic ranking silently\nskips and resolution falls back to keyword matching — the endpoint still returns results, it just\nranks them without embeddings."],[299,"**Kill the conflicting process**:"],[1157,"**Large repositories** (1000+ skills): 10-30 minutes"],[1642,"**Limitations**:"],[2899,"**links**: Reserved for future use"],[322,"**Linux/macOS**: `~/.config/fastskill/global-skills.lock`"],[817,"**Loads Dependencies**: Reads `[dependencies]` section from `skill-project.toml`"],[1862,"**Loads Dependencies**: Reads the declared skills"],[2355,"**Loads the full `SKILL.md`** for relevant skills to get instructions and parameters —\nthe same content `fastskill skill read <skill-id>` prints."],[3090,"**Local catalog**: skill content and catalog metadata on disk."],[1456,"**Local Processing**: No external API calls during search"],[2830,"**Local vector index.** Skill embeddings are stored in a local SQLite vector index (path set by\n`index_path` under `[tool.fastskill.embedding]`), so resolution queries run against on-disk vectors\nwith no external service call at query time."],[1255,"**local**: Local filesystem path"],[1861,"**Locates Project File**: Finds `skill-project.toml` (or, with `--global`, the global skill set)"],[816,"**